00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:42.030
Parisa Ataei: Sure. I'm not advocating for keeping, for example, 3.0 and 3.1. If we see that we can deprecate 3.0 when we have 3.1, I think that's fine. But I'm advocating for, for example, having 3.1 and having 4.0.

75
00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:48.900
Parisa Ataei: And having, instead of… instead of changing… requiring a flag that, for example, is very specific and feature…

