00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:06.939
Kent Dybvig: on, StageNet.

89
00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:16.980
Kent Dybvig: And, there are pros and cons to having it being a completely different compiler version.

90
00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:22.519
