00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:48.769
Kent Dybvig: having to support these feature flags and make sure that each compiler can support multiple backends and multiple… and connect to multiple versions. Ledger is also a pain in the neck, so we need to decide what's… what the user really wants to have.

