00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:13.989
Joseph Denman: and yeah, I guess just a sort of second thing, in passing is… I don't…

116
00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:20.389
Joseph Denman: From the runtime perspective, all of the dependencies are on the on-chain runtime.

117
00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:23.320
Joseph Denman: And so I really don't see a way around this.

