00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:35.069
Kevin Millikin (Shielded Technologies): So one example I can think of is,

129
00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:42.610
Kevin Millikin (Shielded Technologies): There's a… so there's an idea that we could have the function maximum that would return the maximum value of a numeric type.

