00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:57.740
Kevin Millikin (Shielded Technologies): And this is going to require ZKR 3.1 features to implement. So if we supported a flag that allowed somebody to choose 3.0, then they would get a different language that had some… that had some features just not available.

