00:17:18.079 --> 00:17:30.510
Kevin Millikin (Shielded Technologies): And it would only be, I think, if the format of the verifier… of the keys were different, and they had to compile with an older ZKIR to deploy a contract. And if that's not the case, we should not even give them the option of being able to do it.

